          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo alefwaila ku lubali lumbi ulwa lupili, elyo Davidi nao na bantu bakwe ulubali lubiye. Davidi aleendesha ukuti Saulo emumona, lelo Saulo ne fita fyakwe balepalamina mukuti bekate Davidi na bantu bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba pali ilya ine nshita kwaishile inkombe imo kuli Saulo nokutila, “Iseni bwangu! Abafilisiti balapokolola icalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Saulo alekele ukufwaya Davidi no kubwelulukako aya mukukumanya Abafilisiti. Uyu e mulandu wine betila icifulo ici ukuti ni Sela Hamalekoti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sela Hamakeloti:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sela Hamakeloti mu lulimi lwa Cihibulu cipilibula ukuti “ilibwe lyakubutukilamo.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Davidi alifumineko kulya no kuya ikala mu ncengo sha Eni Gedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        }
